m Charts-Repository verfügbar. Der Quellcode des Charts ist auf ",[224,225,229],"a",{"href":226,"rel":227},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Ffivenet-app\u002Fcharts",[228],"nofollow","GitHub fivenet-app\u002Fcharts"," verfügbar.",[232,233,235],"h2",{"id":234},"_0-voraussetzungen","0. Voraussetzungen",[220,237,238,239,244],{},"Diese Anleitung setzt voraus, dass Sie über einen funktionierenden Kubernetes-Cluster und einen installierten Helm-Client verfügen. Falls Sie noch keinen Kubernetes-Cluster eingerichtet haben, lesen Sie bitte die ",[224,240,243],{"href":241,"rel":242},"https:\u002F\u002Fkubernetes.io\u002Fdocs\u002Fsetup\u002F",[228],"Kubernetes-Installationsanleitung",".\nSie können jeden Kubernetes-Cluster verwenden, einschließlich lokaler Cluster wie Minikube oder KinD, oder Cloud-Anbieter wie GKE, EKS oder AKS.",[232,246,248],{"id":247},"_1-helm-chart-repository-hinzufügen","1. Helm-Chart-Repository hinzufügen",[220,250,251],{},"Fügen Sie das FiveNet-Helm-Chart-Repository zu Ihrem Helm-Client hinzu:",[253,254,259],"pre",{"className":255,"code":256,"language":257,"meta":258,"style":258},"language-bash shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","helm repo add fivenet https:\u002F\u002Ffivenet.app\u002Fcharts\nhelm repo update\n","bash","",[260,261,262,284],"code",{"__ignoreMap":258},[263,264,267,271,275,278,281],"span",{"class":265,"line":266},"line",1,[263,268,270],{"class":269},"sBMFI","helm",[263,272,274],{"class":273},"sfazB"," repo",[263,276,277],{"class":273}," add",[263,279,280],{"class":273}," fivenet",[263,282,283],{"class":273}," https:\u002F\u002Ffivenet.app\u002Fcharts\n",[263,285,287,289,291],{"class":265,"line":286},2,[263,288,270],{"class":269},[263,290,274],{"class":273},[263,292,293],{"class":273}," update\n",[232,295,297],{"id":296},"_2-namespace-erstellen","2. Namespace erstellen",[220,299,300],{},"Erstellen Sie einen eigenen Namespace für FiveNet, falls Sie noch keinen haben:",[253,302,304],{"className":255,"code":303,"language":257,"meta":258,"style":258},"kubectl create namespace fivenet\n",[260,305,306],{"__ignoreMap":258},[263,307,308,311,314,317],{"class":265,"line":266},[263,309,310],{"class":269},"kubectl",[263,312,313],{"class":273}," create",[263,315,316],{"class":273}," namespace",[263,318,319],{"class":273}," fivenet\n",[232,321,323,324,327],{"id":322},"_3-aktuelle-valuesyaml-abrufen","3. Aktuelle ",[260,325,326],{},"values.yaml"," abrufen",[220,329,330,331,333],{},"Laden Sie die Standard-",[260,332,326],{},"-Datei für das Helm-Chart herunter, um Ihre Bereitstellung zu konfigurieren:",[253,335,337],{"className":255,"code":336,"language":257,"meta":258,"style":258},"helm show values fivenet\u002Ffivenet > values.yaml\n",[260,338,339],{"__ignoreMap":258},[263,340,341,343,346,349,352,356],{"class":265,"line":266},[263,342,270],{"class":269},[263,344,345],{"class":273}," show",[263,347,348],{"class":273}," values",[263,350,351],{"class":273}," fivenet\u002Ffivenet",[263,353,355],{"class":354},"sMK4o"," >",[263,357,358],{"class":273}," values.yaml\n",[232,360,362,363,365],{"id":361},"_4-valuesyaml-konfigurieren","4. ",[260,364,326],{}," konfigurieren",[220,367,368,369,371,372,375,376,380,381,385,386,389],{},"Bearbeiten Sie die ",[260,370,326],{},"-Datei entsprechend Ihren Bereitstellungsanforderungen. Details zum Abschnitt ",[260,373,374],{},".fivenet.config"," finden Sie auf der ",[224,377,379],{"href":378},"..\u002Fconfiguration\u002Fconfig-reference#must-set-config-options","Konfigurationsreferenzseite",", insbesondere im Abschnitt ",[382,383,384],"strong",{},"\"Must Set Config Options\""," und in der Referenzliste oben, um eine funktionierende ",[260,387,388],{},"config.yaml"," für FiveNet zu erstellen.",[220,391,392],{},"Prüfen Sie mindestens die FiveNet-Konfiguration, Secrets, Persistenz und wie die Bereitstellung in Ihrem Cluster erreichbar sein soll.",[232,394,396],{"id":395},"_5-fivenet-installieren-oder-aktualisieren","5. FiveNet installieren o